  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Runs a two-tier screen on a table of newborn LC-HR-MS features: a classic marker cut-off, then ML re-ranking. It lists high-risk samples with their abnormal analytes (robust z-scores) and a suspected disorder, and lets a specialist record confirm/reject/repeat decisions in an audit trail that can be exported. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
